    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1046">

                <pb facs="1572" n="1546" sameAs="frus:frus1952-54v16/pg1546"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">396.1 GE/7–2154</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Proposal for Insertion in the Final Act, Submitted by
                        the Delegation of the State of Vietnam</hi><anchor n="1" xml:id="d1046-f1"
                    /></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">IC/53</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Geneva</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1954-07-21">21 July 1954</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Conference takes note of the declaration of the Government of the State of
                    Viet-Nam to the effect that it undertakes:</p>
                <p>To make and to support every effort for the restoration of peace in Viet-Nam;</p>
                <p>Not to use force to oppose the agreed procedure for execution of the cease-fire,
                    despite the objections and reservations it has expressed, in particular in its
                    final statement.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
